# Spectra Frontend

App Router under `frontend/`. Auth + branch via existing providers; call API through `lib/api` (JWT + `X-Branch-Id`).

## UX requirements

- **Mobile-first**: drawer nav, touch-friendly controls, horizontal scroll tables OK; no desktop-only critical flows
- Role-gate nav items (`app-shell`); hide platform NGO admin from NGO users and vice versa
- Branch selector required for NGO users; ops respect active branch
- Forms: TanStack Query mutations; invalidate related keys on success
- Prefer existing UI primitives (`components/ui/*`) over new design systems

## Core screens (keep / extend — don’t duplicate)

| Area | Route ideas |
|------|-------------|
| Dogs | residents / dog hub, notes, vaccine modal |
| Inventory | Unified GRN (mixed lines), consumption, `/inventory/audit` |
| Staff store | POS + passbook (same stockroom products) |
| HR | `/leave` absences only (paid or LOP); no attendance calendar |
| Payroll | runs, payslip |
| Ops | `/ops` OpEx / fuel / alerts |

## Example

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — fetch without shared client (drops tenant/branch headers)
await fetch("/api/inventory/batches");

// ✅ GOOD
await api<Batch[]>("/api/inventory/batches");
```

Preserve sand/ink brand tokens already in the app; don’t introduce purple/glow dashboard clichés on branded pages.
